# NodeForge：2026-10-13首次源码上传，根目录采用明确白名单。
# 本机验证工程、ZIP、报告/会话与工作管理资料保留磁盘。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/Plugins/
!/Scripts/
!/Contracts/
!/Catalog/
!/Examples/
!/Tests/
!/Tools/
!/Metadata/
!/Releases/
!/Docs/
/Docs/*
!/Docs/Installation.md
!/Docs/AiInstallation.md
!/Docs/GitHubReleaseDeliveryPlan.md
!/Docs/RepositoryGuide.md
!/Docs/Versions/
/Docs/Versions/*
!/Docs/Versions/Build136/
/Docs/Versions/Build136/*
!/Docs/Versions/Build136/Mcp9R13/
!/Docs/Versions/Build136/Mcp9R19/
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/
/Docs/Versions/Build135/*
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/
/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/*
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/
/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/*
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/GraphAuthoring.md
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/Material.md
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/Blueprint.md
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/MaterialInstance.md
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/Examples.md
!/Docs/Versions/Build135/Mcp8R5/Reference/ResultsAndRecovery.md
!/Docs/PluginControl/
/Docs/PluginControl/*
!/Docs/PluginControl/DocumentationSources/
/Tools/NodeForgeMcp/Environment/
/Tools/NodeForgeMcp/packages/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/*.pyc
# 编译文件不进Git；Release保存选定DLL。
/Plugins/**/Binaries/
/Plugins/**/Intermediate/
/Plugins/**/Saved/
/Plugins/**/DerivedDataCache/
/DevProject/**/Binaries/
/DevProject/**/Intermediate/
/DevProject/**/Saved/
/DevProject/**/DerivedDataCache/
/ValidationProject/**/Binaries/
/ValidationProject/**/Intermediate/
/ValidationProject/**/Saved/
/ValidationProject/**/DerivedDataCache/

# 本机 IDE 缓存与未来生成的工程文件；不忽略上游原始源码快照。
/.vs/
/DevProject/**/.vs/
/ValidationProject/**/.vs/
/Plugins/**/.vs/
/DevProject/*.sln
/DevProject/*.suo
/DevProject/*.VC.db
/ValidationProject/*.sln
/ValidationProject/*.suo
/ValidationProject/*.VC.db
/Scripts/**/__pycache__/
/Scripts/**/.pytest_cache/
/Scripts/**/.venv/
/Scripts/**/*.pyc

# 临时区域必须显式放在这些位置，验证日志与截图应转入 Reports 后保留。
/Temp/
/DevProject/Temp/
/ValidationProject/Temp/
/Builds/Temp/
/Builds/Staging/

# 本机秘密。示例模板可保留，但其中不得包含真实凭据。
/Reports/PluginControlSessions/*/Session.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
**/LocalSecrets/
*.privatekey
*.pfx
*.p12

# JSON、Contracts、Tests及工具品牌资源按白名单保留。
# Plugins、DevProject、ValidationProject 中的 Binaries 属于可重建开发输出。
# Builds、Deliverables和上游原始快照留本机，选定安装包上传Release。
# 忽略不删除文件；不把验证工程或私人会话加入源码提交。
